{
  "schema_version": "1.9.2",
  "id": "USN-9110-1",
  "summary": "libjackson-json-java vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Liao Xinxi discovered that Jackson incorrectly handled the deserialization\nof certain classes. An attacker could possibly use this issue to execute\narbitrary code. (CVE-2017-7525)\n\nIt was discovered that the fix for CVE-2017-7525 was incomplete, as Jackson\nstill allowed the deserialization of certain dangerous classes. An attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2017-15095)\n\nIt was discovered that Jackson incorrectly handled XML external entities.\nAn attacker could possibly use this issue to obtain sensitive information\nor cause a denial of service. (CVE-2019-10172)",
